  "caveats": [
    "1. GGM Stokes constant A_omega = 3 is proved algebraically from the 2-tetrahedra cusp sandwich A_GGM W_-1(q) B_GGM W_-1(q)^T C_GGM (S^+_12 + S^+_21 = 3 S^+_11 at all q); while A_omega = 3 lifts the T5 pure-boost ceiling to 0.014142 > S_mu = 0.009683, the particle-specific angular deformation vartheta_K remains an open G3 monodromy input (bean qou-qnnq) and the l^1-ceiling still precludes closing nuclear binding by per-block Delta_lambda weights alone. 2. Coupling |1^A> to the (4, 41, 461) hidden-colour reconnection channels in S^{[A,A,A]} strictly lowers the ground energy across all 6 pre-registered zero-parameter models (resolving the wrong-sign unbinding of the factorized single-gamma-gamma chain), and complete-graph K_A pair exchange (V2) boosts the A=2 -> 3 -> 4 scaling from chain (1:2:3) to pairwise (~1:3:6), but still misses the super-pairwise alpha-cluster jump (1:3.81:12.72) without spin-isospin SU(4) Wigner [4] space-exchange weighting and a derived energy-scale unit (W6 R = tau_e / hbar_q^2 ~ 70.40)."
  ],
